desc = Draw a line of blocks between two points
start.desc = Start position (x y z, supports ~ for relative)
end.desc = End position (x y z, supports ~ for relative)
material.desc = Block material pattern (e.g. Rock_Stone or Rock_Stone,Soil_Grass)
width.desc = Line width (default: 1)
height.desc = Line height (default: 1)
wallThickness.desc = Wall thickness for hollow lines (0 = solid)
shape.desc = Line shape (Cube, Sphere, Cylinder, Cone, etc.)
origin.desc = Shape origin point (Center, Bottom, Top)
spacing.desc = Block interval along the line (default: 1)
density.desc = Random chance (1-100) that each block is placed (default: 100)
